OL,3,GNEWSAConstruction work begins on #24m
OL,4,Ameat processing plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction work has started on a #24m
OL,7,Fmeat processing plant in the south of
OL,8,FScotland.
OL,10,FThe Pickstock Telford development near
OL,11,FEcclefechan should deliver about 90
OL,12,Fjobs in a rural area as well as help
OL,13,Freduce food miles.
OL,15,FConcerns have been expressed about
OL,16,Fpotential odour, noise and pollution
OL,17,Ffrom the project but the company said
OL,18,Fit had taken steps to allay those
OL,19,Ffears.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
